# Unified Dashboard Environment Guide
# Each app loads ONLY its own env file:
#
#   Backend:  backend/.env (or backend/.env.local)
#     - Database: PORT, MONGODB_URL, CLIENT_URL, JWT_SECRET, JWT_EXPIRES_IN
#     - eBay API: EBAY_CLIENT_ID, EBAY_CLIENT_SECRET, EBAY_DEV_ID, EBAY_RUNAME, EBAY_ENV
#     - TikTok Shop US: TIKTOK_SHOP_APP_KEY, TIKTOK_SHOP_APP_SECRET, TIKTOK_SHOP_SERVICE_ID
#     - Temu US: TEMU_APP_KEY, TEMU_APP_SECRET
#     - AI / OpenAI: OPENAI_API
#     See backend/.env.example for full details.
#
#   Frontend: frontend/.env (or frontend/.env.local)
#     - VITE_API_URL (leave empty for local dev proxy)
#     - VITE_PORT (default 5173)
#     See frontend/.env.example for details.
#
# On deployment (e.g. Vercel), set these keys in your deployment platform's Environment Variables.
